            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Alchemist Shop Simulator</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Hug them all! Don’t forget about anyone :)<br><br>We wanted to see people of different cultures, religions, political options, beliefs, races, skin colour, historical figures, fairy-tale characters, celebrities and all living beings ;) pass to each other the sign of peace – a hug. In one place, in one game. One hug can change the world. We really believe that this is possible. <br><br>* A unique memory game about hugging<br>* Unique, positive, funny and non-violent world<br>* Over 100 characters to unlock, with many more to come<br>* Character editor - mix heads with the bodies, over twenty thousands freaky mixes to reveal<br>* 10 different locations, more to come<br>* Several mini arcade games about collecting green leaves<br>* New quests every day<br>* Green lottery with special prizes and power ups<br>* Global hug counter for community challenge<br>* The ”80s TV” mode available<br><br>Hug everyone, but only once, and don’t forget about anyone… Are you up to the challenge? And remember – every day is a lost one if you did not laugh… or hug… :)",
            "about_the_game": "Hug them all! Don’t forget about anyone :)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe wanted to see people of different cultures, religions, political options, beliefs, races, skin colour, historical figures, fairy-tale characters, celebrities and all living beings ;) pass to each other the sign of peace – a hug. In one place, in one game. One hug can change the world. We really believe that this is possible. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n* A unique memory game about hugging<br />\r\n* Unique, positive, funny and non-violent world<br />\r\n* Over 100 characters to unlock, with many more to come<br />\r\n* Character editor - mix heads with the bodies, over twenty thousands freaky mixes to reveal<br />\r\n* 10 different locations, more to come<br />\r\n* Several mini arcade games about collecting green leaves<br />\r\n* New quests every day<br />\r\n* Green lottery with special prizes and power ups<br />\r\n* Global hug counter for community challenge<br />\r\n* The ”80s TV” mode available<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHug everyone, but only once, and don’t forget about anyone… Are you up to the challenge? And remember – every day is a lost one if you did not laugh… or hug… :)",
            "short_description": "One hug can change the world. Hug once every creature you meet. Don’t forget anyone.",
