                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "197116478",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198029314628",
                            "num_reviews": 105,
                            "playtime_forever": 1362,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1,
                            "playtime_at_review": 454,
                            "last_played": 1793301248
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After pressing random buttons to find out the controls, the game became quite entertaining to play! Very short and easy, and that's all it needs for a game with such a light-hearted name and motivation.\n\nHowever, when you unlocked enough characters and stars, some tasks are \"Finish Day 6+ in ONE game\" which really feels like work since the amount of characters you need to remember increases each day. \nAnd they vary by combining heads and bodies randomly incrasingly. \nI even reached a point of \"finish day 8 in ONE game\", which basically means \"spend one hour trial-and-erroring against RNG\". \nStarting at Day 4 or so: One mistake and youre done. \nFailsaves won't have a fast enough cooldown to use twice in a row.",
